WEBVTT

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.450
What are you doing here, Patrizia?

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:37.490
They said there was an
accident during training!

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.460
Happens all the time! It's nothing!

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:43.660
Thank goodness...

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:53.370
So you were dismissed
because your eyesight grew bad?

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.240
It was a dog-eat-dog line of work.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.250
The squad captain probably
wanted to get rid of me anyway.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:04.890
But you didn't have to quit
working for the police altogether.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:07.560
Surely you could still
do ordinary police work?

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:16.490
Go back to being a patrolman
or a pencil-pusher? I think I'll pass.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:28.310
It's no big deal. Someone like
me has plenty of places to work!

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:32.150
Army airborne division.
Navy command unit.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.680
The military police would be great, too!

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:40.020
I'm fine with you being
a regular policeman, Marco...

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.220
What? You don't like strong men?

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.960
I want to see how far I can push myself!

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.060
Should I not follow my dreams?

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.330
No, it isn't like that.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:56.100
But I like the gentle Marco.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:09.880
Don't worry! I'll find new
work before you know it!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:21.200
Amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:36.180
I want to protect you and fulfill
my promise to the only one for me

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:43.720
In a world filled with doubt,
I still can't find the answer

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:50.990
Even so, I continue forward... Why?

00:02:50.990 --> 00:03:01.140
If I can change this dream-like
reality with my own two hands,

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:08.810
amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:16.420
I want to protect the only one for me

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:24.360
I swear on my beating heart I will
continue to run until I burn away

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:31.600
Amid the eternal love
I feel simply by living,

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:39.630
I want to fulfill my promise

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.840
"Montecitorio Palace"

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.290
Listen.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.630
Ask the president to lay the
groundwork for lifetime senatorship.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.030
He's quite popular, after all.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:03.430
It looks like the reform will pass easily.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.000
I'll make sure it does. This nation is sick.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.940
It needs antibiotics.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.940
Hey, you! Get back!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.490
Are you all right, sir?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.010
Yeah...

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.230
Did you get that picture?

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.630
Of course.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.630
Put it on the evening news.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.970
In a way that appeals
to upstanding citizens.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.080
Have you identified
the person responsible?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:52.010
Just some nameless separatist.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:57.020
Those F.R.F. Guys really
want to tear Italy apart.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.920
Shall we declare this an act of the F.R.F?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.390
Of course.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:08.860
The F.R.F. Is the most radical
and most deserving of public criticism.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:12.930
Truths are created by people, after all.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.370
What've they been up to lately?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:20.140
The largest sect, the Milan Group,
is clashing behind closed doors.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:24.140
Take the offensive. Spread some false info.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:27.480
Arrest any sympathizers
hiding in the media.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.150
Understood.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:34.350
Only I need to know the truth, after all.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.010
Giuse-san!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.820
Could you watch from
down here for a little bit?

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.290
Sure! I'll be right there!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.520
It's been a month
since the incident in Milan.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.830
It looks like Angelica will be fine now.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:17.970
I don't know.
I bet she'll collapse on me again.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.960
Don't talk like that.

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:26.270
She doesn't have long to live,
regardless. It's not like before.

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:32.410
The girl I knew was
never that good with a gun.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:37.680
The Angelica I once
adored is long gone now.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:46.100
"Evanescence and Reminiscence"

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.710
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:03.010
I'm sorry, Marco-san!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:07.170
I'm the one to blame!
I wasn't concentrating...

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:14.990
Angelica. That's enough for today.
You can return to the dorms.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.920
Y-Yes, sir!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.440
Triela...

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.970
Please don't touch me!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:37.570
Please let me be by myself for a while...

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.980
What is it, Amadeo?

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.450
The princess is feeling down.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:17.080
Is this what a child
prodigy's setback looks like?

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.990
To think a cyborg...
Princess Triela, at that...

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:22.590
would lose to a flesh-and-blood person...

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:25.990
What kind of monster
is this Pinocchio guy?

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:29.390
Must be a 230 cm-tall giant.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.870
Triela!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.740
What are you doing up there?!

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.770
Come down! I have something for you!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.520
What might that be?

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:55.760
Quit being so childish.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.860
I am a child.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:03.530
Here. A new gun.
You lost yours in Montalcino, right?

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:07.260
It's a P-232. The same as mine.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.060
Thank you.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.680
Is having your gun taken
that much of a shock for you?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:20.050
You'll have your chance
to take it back someday.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.180
I won't lose next time.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:26.480
Oh, yeah! Hold on to this.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.990
What is it?

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.200
Angelica!

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.440
- On your way back?
- Yes, Priscilla-san.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.540
I'll give you a lift!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.240
You hurt your hand?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.550
Oh! Yeah! It's nothing at all!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.960
Are you holding on tight, Angelica?

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.490
Yes, Priscilla-san!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.160
"Priscilla-san," huh?

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.690
Eh?

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:16.060
Call me "Priscilla-chan"!

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:21.630
"Rotonda Square"

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:36.620
Welfare work? Weren't you going
to rejoin the military police?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:40.630
The job's in Rome, and it's 50% more pay!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:44.000
What do you do at the
Social Welfare Agency?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:49.500
Oh, you know, look after kids.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.670
You? That's surprising!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.980
Why's that?

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:59.110
I mean, you wanted
to be a strong man, right?

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:03.380
But I think it's the perfect job for you.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:14.130
Hey, Patrizia! Fancy meeting you here!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:17.300
Leo! You're so stubborn, too!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:21.600
I think you know by now,
but I'm never going to sit with you.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:24.570
Oof! Talk about heartless!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.870
I can't believe there's
a woman who can say no

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:31.140
to Leonardo Conti, ace reporter.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:36.410
Come on, now. You don't have
a man to fill that seat anyway.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.720
Oh? Is this the fairytale
masterpiece I've heard about?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.260
I hear it's selling nicely.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.730
The Prince of the Pasta Kingdom, huh?

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.570
Who's the author?

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:52.630
It's a secret.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:57.040
Hey. I like women who have secrets.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.880
Social Welfare Agency?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.750
What about it?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:09.680
Say. I know a big secret myself.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.280
Wanna hear?

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:12.840
What is it?

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.690
The truth is, the Social Welfare Agency

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.290
is a secret government intelligence agency.

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.990
Yeah. I know.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:30.370
"Tiber River, Rome"

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.600
"Tiber River, Rome"
My old boyfriend worked
at the Social Welfare Agency.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:35.280
My old boyfriend worked
at the Social Welfare Agency.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:38.980
And he told you the agency's secrets?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.980
No, he didn't say anything.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:45.120
- But I knew.
- How so?

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:49.320
He was a gung-ho special forces member.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:52.690
He would never suddenly
switch to charity work!

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.030
Why did you break up?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.500
Because it seemed like he was hurting.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:04.840
But it might've been me, actually.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.860
I was afraid of knowing the truth.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.310
"Orange Park"

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.330
Is something troubling you, Miss?

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:28.120
You look taken aback.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.600
Do you not understand Italian?

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.870
I understand. Only a little...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:41.740
Sightseeing? I can help you
out if you need anything.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.070
Thanks! I'm okay!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:50.220
I was amazed at how pretty the city is...

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.410
I'm happy you like Italy.

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:05.250
I like the view from here, too.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:12.930
I'm glad we feel the same
way about something.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.110
Are you doing a story
on the Social Welfare Agency?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.220
I hear the agency is raising
children to be assassins,

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:25.220
under the guise of "social welfare."

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.820
That can't be true. I haven't heard
anything like that on the news.

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:31.730
The fact that it isn't in the news
is more proof than anything.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:35.660
Almost all of the country's media
is controlled by the prime minister.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:38.530
Meaning it's basically government-run.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:41.330
He is the "media king" of Italy.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:47.570
But... the Welfare Agency
does do charity work!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.480
I've even visited it before...

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:56.480
I have my own vision
of how the country should be.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:59.920
The public might not care about the truth.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:04.220
But I want to lift the veil of
darkness that covers this country.

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:12.970
Say, Patrizia.
Will you help me with my story?

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.840
Eh?

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:18.240
I take it you're curious
about your ex-boyfriend?

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:20.770
Given that you carry
that scrap paper around.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.240
You want to know the truth, don't you?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.190
Spooky, isn't it?

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:42.900
Policemen, officials, politicians...

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:49.530
They all deny it as if they've gotten
together to get their story straight.

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:55.510
Is it true about the child assassins?

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.050
The editorial department
got an anonymous tip.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:07.250
It was taken in the area.
It's not a clear shot, but you can see it.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:13.030
Do you think Marco is doing
dirty work for the government?

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:19.360
Who knows? There are lots
of brands of justice, after all.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:25.940
Say. Do you have a photo
of your old boyfriend?

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.310
Or contact info for an
old boss or something?

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.710
Eh?

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:35.310
"Several Days Later"
"Rome Magazine House"

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:44.290
Leonardo!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.390
Heya, Editor! You're early today!

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:49.330
There's no smoking in here.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.850
I'm just holding it in my mouth.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:57.530
There was a call for you.
From a police officer.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:09.810
Hello. This is Conti.
Thank you for the other day.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:15.120
I remembered a rumor I had heard
about the Social Welfare Agency.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:19.030
There's supposedly a secret
office outside of Rome.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:22.030
They say suspicious
people come and go there.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:26.230
Thank you. I think I'll check it out today.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.960
No thanks needed.
I hope you find out something.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.410
How was that?

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:38.240
Thank you for your assistance,
Lieutenant Colonel.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:43.440
How's Marco doing?
It was a shame he left the police.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.890
My investigation is progressing well.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:50.220
I think I can organize it into
a report after a little more research.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.620
Don't push too hard.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:56.330
But anything you find out about
the government assassins will help.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.200
Are you working on the kidnapping plan?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:01.330
I look forward to the results.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:06.410
I don't know. I doubt it'll be enough
to stop the bridge's construction.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.480
But it should make for good publicity.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.180
Indeed...

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:14.350
Oh, my companion's here. I'll call later.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.080
Did I interrupt anything?

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.090
No, not at all!

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:21.080
Well, let's go!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.310
Deserted, huh?

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:48.550
Freeze!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:52.040
Leonardo Conti. You're under arrest.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.590
You're Marco-san, right?

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.660
You can arrest me even
though you quit the force?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.390
How do you know about me?

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:03.730
You screwed up your life.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:07.670
You made your woman cry,
and joined forces with the wrong side.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.640
I what?!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.300
Marco?

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.110
Patrizia! Why are you here?!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:17.010
I know him from work...

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.610
What are you doing here?!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:24.820
Get away from him! He's with the Padania!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:25.940
Eh?!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:30.320
Leo?

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:33.690
Sorry, Patrizia. I used you.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.800
It's true?!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:39.530
Marco-san. I checked your background.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:44.770
The Central Security Operations
Service is quite an elite unit.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:46.760
Why did you quit?

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:52.350
Not only that, you dumped
this adorable woman...

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.050
Is that how badly you wanted to
do the government's dirty work?!

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.080
Shut up!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.450
Things didn't turn out this way
because I wanted them to!

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:03.820
I've had enough!
I'm going to blow your mouth off!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:07.220
I know you injured your eye.

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:11.160
You don't want to hit her, do you?!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.570
Angelica!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:21.970
A government agency that uses kids...

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.150
Patrizia...

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.930
Don't get any more involved with this...

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:43.760
Why?

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.030
Are you doing this
dirty work for your dreams?

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.560
So you can test your skill?!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:02.320
Patrizia...

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:07.510
I didn't want things to turn out
this way, either. Please believe me.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.620
It sure is hot today!

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:40.290
Yes... Priscilla-chan.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:43.380
And so we returned closer than before...

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:49.230
You're back in the dorms, right?
What do you normally do?

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:53.030
Ordering her to call me in a friendly way...

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:55.160
How will that work out?

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:58.170
I'm reading a picture book.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.730
It's called The Prince of the Pasta Kingdom.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:08.720
Oh! How is it? Do you like it?

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:10.410
Yes!

00:22:14.590 --> 00:22:18.180
If only we could go back to those days...

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:41.280
We're not pros, so it
doesn't need to be complex!

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:47.550
Fairytales you still remember as an adult

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:51.610
are simple and have memorable scenes.

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:03.800
Okay! All done!

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:15.640
I'd say she's going to be protecting me!

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.310
Only because you're no good!

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:28.260
And so, after getting the platinum
fork on the mountain of fire,

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:32.720
the prince safely returned
to the kingdom with the princess.

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:37.460
What do you think?

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:41.100
It was great!

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:57.890
A doll without a heart,
born from warm hands

00:23:57.890 --> 00:24:07.200
I neither smile nor talk

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:15.480
I want you to hear about
these feelings someday,

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:23.520
though they can't be put into words

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:31.690
I'll summon all my strength

00:24:31.690 --> 00:24:44.630
to know what it means to live

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:04.980
"Retirement of the Tibetan Terrier"
